        "html": "<section class=\"section no-padding-top\"><div class=\"ui-blockcontainer container ui-container\"><div id=\"ui-node-_12e2c3e5-0946-16d6-8d25-b03ffc62d6c8-fc62d6c8\" class=\"faq\"><div class=\"child-grid-layout\"><div class=\"section-label-wrap\"><div class=\"label-content\"><div class=\"label-line black\"></div><div class=\"label-text black\">ASK US</div></div></div></div><div id=\"ui-node-_12e2c3e5-0946-16d6-8d25-b03ffc62d6cc-fc62d6c8\" class=\"faq-wrap\"><h2 class=\"heading-h1\">FAQs</h2><div data-current=\"Tab 1\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-duration-in=\"300\" data-duration-out=\"100\" class=\"faq-tab ui-tabs\"><div class=\"faq-tab-menu ui-tab-menu\"><a data-w-tab=\"Tab 1\" class=\"faq-tab-link ui-inline-block ui-tab-link ui--current\"><div class=\"faq-content\"><div class=\"title-faq-tab\">How long does a typical project take?</div><div class=\"desc-faq-tab-wrap\"><div class=\"desc-faq-tab\">Our engagement timelines generally range from 4 to 12 weeks, depending on the specific complexity and scope of the digital product.</div></div></div><div class=\"faq-icon\"><div class=\"plus-icon\"></div><div class=\"plus-icon _02\"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab=\"Tab 2\" class=\"faq-tab-link ui-inline-block ui-tab-link\"><div class=\"faq-content\"><div class=\"title-faq-tab\">Do you offer post-launch support?</div><div class=\"desc-faq-tab-wrap\"><div class=\"desc-faq-tab\">Conax offers tiered Post-Launch Evolution packages that include everything from security patches and technical maintenance to iterative UX improvements.</div></div></div><div class=\"faq-icon\"><div class=\"plus-icon\"></div><div class=\"plus-icon _02\"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab=\"Tab 3\" class=\"faq-tab-link ui-inline-block ui-tab-link\"><div class=\"faq-content\"><div class=\"title-faq-tab\">Can you work with our existing dev team?</div><div class=\"desc-faq-tab-wrap\"><div class=\"desc-faq-tab\">Yes, we are highly experienced in integrated workflows and &quot;frictionless handoffs.&quot; We utilize Figma as our primary design source of truth</div></div></div><div class=\"faq-icon\"><div class=\"plus-icon\"></div><div class=\"plus-icon _02\"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab=\"Tab 4\" class=\"faq-tab-link ui-inline-block ui-tab-link\"><div class=\"faq-content\"><div class=\"title-faq-tab\">What industries do you specialize in?</div><div class=\"desc-faq-tab-wrap\"><div class=\"desc-faq-tab\">While our design principles are universal, we possess deep-rooted expertise in high-growth sectors such as Fintech, SaaS, AI-driven platforms.</div></div></div><div class=\"faq-icon\"><div class=\"plus-icon\"></div><div class=\"plus-icon _02\"></div></div></a><a data-w-tab=\"Tab 5\" class=\"faq-tab-link ui-inline-block ui-tab-link\"><div class=\"faq-content\"><div class=\"title-faq-tab\">Is your design process collaborative?</div><div class=\"desc-faq-tab-wrap\"><div class=\"desc-faq-tab\">Our process is built on radical transparency and iterative feedback. We begin with a deep-dive discovery phase to align on your business goals</div></div></div><div class=\"faq-icon\"><div class=\"plus-icon\"></div><div class=\"plus-icon _02\"></div></div></a></div><div class=\"hide ui-tab-content\"><div data-w-tab=\"Tab 1\" class=\"ui-tab-pane ui--tab-active\"></div><div data-w-tab=\"Tab 2\" class=\"ui-tab-pane\"></div><div data-w-tab=\"Tab 3\" class=\"ui-tab-pane\"></div><div data-w-tab=\"Tab 4\" class=\"ui-tab-pane\"></div><div data-w-tab=\"Tab 5\" class=\"ui-tab-pane\"></div></div></div><div class=\"get-contact\"><div class=\"section-label-wrap\"><div class=\"label-content\"><div class=\"label-line black\"></div><div class=\"label-text black\">SPECIFIC QUESTION?</div></div></div><div id=\"ui-node-_12e2c3e5-0946-16d6-8d25-b03ffc62d70c-fc62d6c8\" class=\"sub-get-contact\"><div class=\"heading-h6 semi-boild\">CONTACT US</div><a data-anim-id=\"anim-57ae2082\" href=\"/contact\" class=\"secondar-button ui-inline-block\"><div class=\"layer-default secondary\"><div class=\"text-button-wrap\"><div class=\"text-button\">Get in Touch</div></div></div><div class=\"layer-hover secondary\"><div class=\"text-button-wrap\"><div class=\"text-button absolute\">Get in Touch</div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"ui-node-e708577b-1e23-dd06-1470-07a5b2d1c9bb-b2d1c9bb\" class=\"grid-overlay\"><div id=\"ui-node-e708577b-1e23-dd06-1470-07a5b2d1c9bc-b2d1c9bb\" class=\"line-overlay _01 black\"></div><div id=\"ui-node-e708577b-1e23-dd06-1470-07a5b2d1c9bd-b2d1c9bb\" class=\"line-overlay _02 black\"></div><div id=\"ui-node-e708577b-1e23-dd06-1470-07a5b2d1c9be-b2d1c9bb\" class=\"line-overlay _03 black\"></div></div></section>"
